id: pm-memory-release-gate
title: Release readiness behind PM_RELEASE_APPROVED
description: "Prepare daily OIDC publishing behind one repository approval variable. Verify metadata, allowlisted packed files, privacy, regression checks, npm and Bun release gates. The owner performs the first npm publish and trusted-publisher setup; keep approval unset."
type: Chore
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-25T23:21:38.707Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-27T09:43:44.790Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-27T09:41:03.154Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-27T04:59:28.000Z"
author: codex-agent
resolution: "Delivered release-ready daily OIDC publishing guarded by PM_RELEASE_APPROVED and exact repository conditions, preserving package metadata, packed consumers and owner-controlled first publication."
expected_result: "Automated publishing requires main, the canonical repository, explicit approval and OIDC provenance, with correct public package metadata and full npm/Bun CI gates."
actual_result: "Current main passes 31 focused release-approval/CI tests with no failures or skips. Inspected workflow and manifest match the contracts; merged PR #16 records complete npm/Bun gates and packed privacy/consumer validation. No owner publish, trust setup or approval change is performed."
comments[15]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-25T23:21:43.000Z",codex-agent,"Normalize daily scheduling and PM_RELEASE_APPROVED job gates while preserving release decisions, generated changelogs and release notes. Verify OIDC publishing without a stored npm token, manifest metadata, packed allowlists and private-data scans. No open homepage/author PR was found during orientation. No publishing, trust setup, approval variable changes or merges are authorized."
  "2026-10-25T23:36:21.441Z",codex-agent,"Pack verification: npm pack --dry-run --json and the actual npm pack --ignore-scripts artifact agree on 66 allowlisted files (dist: 60; root files: 6). Every packed member was scanned for absolute home paths, npm/GitHub/cloud tokens, private keys, hosted-data locations, private addresses and historical owner email addresses: PASS with zero matches. Regression proof: five independent workflow mutations (approval, provenance, token environment, daily schedule and OR bypass) plus the original manifest each fail the new contract check; restored contract passes 4/4. The linked test also passes through pm test --run --progress. Next gates: npm run release:check and bun run release:check with isolated HOME and Git configuration."
  "2026-10-25T23:49:55.265Z",codex-agent,"CI previously executed the complete npm gate as individually listed steps. Consolidated those steps into npm run release:check so the required npm and Bun entrypoints are both exercised directly on the PR. Retained the explicit identity check and Bun graph-install check; no source thresholds or release checks were removed. Restoring the previous CI workflow makes the new entrypoint regression fail; restored check passes 1/1."
  "2026-10-25T23:53:58.132Z",codex-agent,"The first Bun release gate reached packed acceptance after all source checks passed, then npm itself reported Exit handler never called during the Bun consumer activation. The npm release gate passed earlier. Retrying the unchanged focused packed acceptance before rerunning the full Bun gate; no retries or exclusions are being added to the package tests."
  "2026-10-26T00:14:07.744Z",codex-agent,"Full local gates PASS: npm run release:check and bun run release:check, each with isolated HOME, GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null and GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1. Suite receipts: npm: 1/1/1/1/2/1/1/1/250/2 tests; bun: 1/1/1/1/2/1/1/1/251/2 tests. No thresholds were relaxed. The package remains unpublished and the approval variable unset; first publication requires the owner login and initial trusted-publisher registration. For the local first publish, explicitly override provenance with --provenance=false because publishConfig enables provenance for cloud CI. CI must confirm the final PR head. The tracker item stays in progress for orchestrator verification."
  "2026-10-27T00:09:41.958Z",codex-agent,"Review follow-up: preserve existing release-readiness work and merged main changes. Remove automatic release-workflow enablement; the orchestrator enables disabled schedules after merge. Require the canonical repository at job level for every write-permission or publishing job in the affected workflows, alongside the existing approval and branch conditions. Prove guard, approval, provenance and token regressions independently, then wait for complete npm and Bun CI on the pushed head."
  "2026-10-27T00:10:11.833Z",codex-agent,"Packed-artifact verification: 66 allowlisted files; dry-run and actual archive agree, and every packed member has zero private-data findings. Local project health passes with extensions disabled; globally installed extension version skew is outside this package."
  "2026-10-27T00:10:15.609Z",codex-agent,"Fork-exclusion revert proof: node --test --test-concurrency=2 test/release-approval.test.ts passes 6/6. Independently reverting each job repository guard, reverting all repository guards, allowing an OR bypass, removing approval or provenance, injecting a synthetic npm token environment, adding an unguarded CI write job, inheriting CI write permissions, adding a read-permission CI publisher, and restoring automatic setup all fail (each command exits nonzero; 12 independent mutations rejected). Restoring the workflows passes 6/6. Linked pm tests, test typecheck where present and lint pass. Canonical-repository checks include inherited permissions. Disabled release workflows remain for the orchestrator to enable after merge; no live settings or publishing were changed."
  "2026-10-27T03:17:38.562Z",codex-agent,"Independent re-review found the contract covered only release and CI files, missing CodeQL security-events writes, owner-only Dependabot guards and reusable workflow callers. Extend canonical-repository guards to every effectively write-enabled job in every workflow file. Replace regex workflow parsing with a pinned YAML parser, generic permission inheritance and negative fixtures for this full class. Correct local publishing documentation, preserve earlier readiness work, prove source reverts and wait for npm/Bun CI on every final head."
  "2026-10-27T03:51:58.916Z",codex-agent,"Whole-workflow contract passes 30/30 using the pinned YAML parser. It scans every YAML workflow, resolves aliases/flow maps, applies job permission overrides or workflow inheritance, and recognizes any scope with write plus write-all, including reusable callers. Negative fixtures cover CodeQL, owner-only/wrong-repository Dependabot, inherited writes, reusable calls, write-all, future scopes, missing publication approval/provenance, provenance overrides, token environments, OR/negation bypasses and discovery of a new workflow in a non-Git directory. Behavioural revert proof: all 13 independent mutations fail with assertion failures: each write job loses only its repository guard, owner-only/OR guards return, approval/provenance disappear, a synthetic token environment is added, file discovery is narrowed back to release/CI, permission matching returns to a scope allowlist, or inheritance is removed. Restoring the implementation passes 30/30. Linked pm tests and the repository's defined typecheck, lint and duplication checks pass. Maintainer local publishing is authenticated and checked, with no approval-variable hold; the variable gates automated GitHub releases."
  "2026-10-27T04:00:04.119Z",codex-agent,"Packed consumer CI found that adding the YAML audit dependency with save-dev moved the existing runtime yaml requirement out of dependencies. Restore the original runtime requirement and lockfile classification, preserving its version range. Verify the existing real npm/Bun packed activation tests and the full workflow contract, with no retries, skips or threshold changes."
  "2026-10-27T04:07:02.376Z",codex-agent,"Runtime dependency correction verified: restore the original dependencies.yaml requirement ^2.9.1 and its production lockfile classification; the resolved parser version remains 2.9.1. Existing npm run test:install passes 2/2 unmodified real npm/Bun packed consumers, including host activation and SDK execution. The preceding CI head failed packed Bun activation because yaml was classified as development-only; this is the observed negative proof, not a skipped check: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-memory/actions/runs/40446567606 . All other package dependency locations were checked against their starting heads and preserved. The full YAML contract and linked tests pass; full CI must verify the corrected head."
  "2026-10-27T09:40:27.226Z",codex-agent,"Closure audit of current main: Inspected the daily OIDC workflow, package metadata, publishing documentation and whole-workflow YAML permission contract on main. The contract requires the canonical repository for write jobs, PM_RELEASE_APPROVED and main for publishing, provenance and public access, and rejects npm token environments. The CI contract requires both npm and Bun release entrypoints. PR #16 retains packed inventory/privacy and real consumer evidence; first publication and trusted-publisher setup remain owner operations. Delivered by PR #16, merge commit 4aea7969d32db0429dc3f2158cc28e57e7b2e1d1, merged_at 2026-10-27T04:59:28Z. Focused verification follows; full npm and Bun release gates are delegated to PR CI for this tracker-only change."
  "2026-10-27T09:40:54.167Z",codex-agent,"Verified current main with `node --test --test-concurrency=2 test/release-approval.test.ts test/release-ci.test.ts` via the pinned pm linked runner: PASS. Current main passes 31 focused release-approval/CI tests with no failures or skips. Inspected workflow and manifest match the contracts; merged PR #16 records complete npm/Bun gates and packed privacy/consumer validation. No owner publish, trust setup or approval change is performed."
  "2026-10-27T09:43:44.790Z",codex-agent,"Closure validation: project tracker health passes strictly with extensions disabled. Default health reports only the existing global extension version skew (extension_host_pm_cli_version_skew:2026.10.24:2026.10.26:pm-github). This local extension warning is separate from delivered acceptance and is not represented as a passing default health result. Dependency pins and global extensions are unchanged."
